# MedSlot pre-commit hook.
#
# 1. lint-staged: auto-format and lint only the staged files (fast).
# 2. typecheck: project-wide TypeScript check (catches cross-file breakage).
# 3. test: the FULL suite — unit AND integration.
#
# Integration tests run against a local Postgres. If it is not reachable they
# are skipped automatically (not failed), so a commit still succeeds without it.
# To actually run them, start the database first:
#   docker compose up -d
#
# In a genuine emergency you can skip all of these checks with:
#   git commit --no-verify
pnpm lint-staged
pnpm typecheck
pnpm test
